OL,3,GNEWSAManhunt after teenage girl raped
OL,4,Ain riverside park
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are looking for a man after a
OL,7,Fteenage girl was raped in a park.
OL,9,FThe attack happened at approximately
OL,10,F11:30 GMT on Wednesday in Parade
OL,11,FGardens in Bath, Somerset.
OL,13,FAvon and Somerset Police said forensic
OL,14,Fand CCTV inquiries were taking place to
OL,15,Fidentify the suspect, who was described
OL,16,Fas a black male with short dark hair
OL,17,Fand was said to be clean shaven.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
